{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>有「三億千金」之稱的張寶兒（Bowie）與「雙料視帝」袁偉豪在2017年因合作拍攝TVB真人騷節目《打工捱世界II》而結緣，兩人於2020年結婚，婚後育有兩子「袁咕碌」及「袁氹氹」，一家四口住入6500萬豪宅，生活幸福美滿。早前張寶兒分享疑因樓上廁所渠裂，導致屋企「漏屎水」，甚至令電視機跳Fuse（保險絲），幸而問題得解決。張寶兒近日又曬出豪宅內部，即使身為千金小姐的張寶兒都要親自為豪宅打掃，十分貼地！</p><figure><img alt=\"張寶兒於個人社交平台大吐苦水。（IG@_bowiecheung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136330035540529152470628.jpeg/e4R3CpVGorDQzHWBZxHmNE3fgfwnFY5gQhPB5kITweY\"/><figcaption>張寶兒於個人社交平台大吐苦水。（IG@_bowiecheung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"張寶兒袁偉豪宅達2,205平方呎，（IG@_bowiecheung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260527/1136330324670681088530479.jpeg/4mfHtsrfIe5Pk3-zrMxviG8iCKCbis4nBqudmQarnZk\"/><figcaption>張寶兒袁偉豪宅達2,205平方呎，（IG@_bowiecheung）</figcaption></figure><p>張寶兒曬半億豪宅勁闊落</p><p>張寶兒日前在社交網分享打掃豪宅的片段。張寶兒解釋，由於當日幫手打掃的阿姨放假，張寶兒用了兩小時清潔全屋。張寶兒先曬出家中裝潢，豪宅以暖色為基調，簡約又大氣，充滿溫馨的感覺。豪宅空間闊落，出面亦有一個私人花園，張寶兒將衣服放在花園晾乾，又有地方讓小朋友活動，住得相當舒適。</p><p>張寶兒購買的是皮具梳化，她愛錫家具，小心翼翼地用滾筒和濕毛巾清潔梳化，又拍埋梳化抱枕的塵。張寶兒熨衫、跪在地下清潔地板，湊住兩個仔一腳踢，忙碌又充實。完成後她躺在梳化上，一臉滿足。</p><figure><img alt=\"張寶兒曝光6500萬豪宅。（抖音）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260616/1143617985991413760716234.png/TraWln-L03a2uot10yhfmucygAkILUVmScV_sEnFf7A\"/><figcaption>張寶兒曝光6500萬豪宅。（抖音）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"空間闊落。（抖音）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260616/1143617983353065472365209.png/QzI2zZOGNw2V7Jn8Rc5v0xBDfMsP5czkW9Szl1vUs5c\"/><figcaption>空間闊落。（抖音）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"仲有花園。（抖音）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260616/1143617980555333632950328.png/njbA7zir5XEzn7tiJiDXgfxLCRSh-K7pc62tDXOtrQ0\"/><figcaption>仲有花園。（抖音）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好大！（抖音）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260616/1143617991914033152312047.png/fd-bD8dU_kwvsrHyKbNS1WWqbYzNEm-jsU-Vl7FPlZc\"/><figcaption>好大！（抖音）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"仔仔瞓梳化。（抖音）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260616/1143617989443457024567089.png/RU95u7F3NR0_CtRg7JU5DymXGg_2JuyqPzJlBD8yZQQ\"/><figcaption>仔仔瞓梳化。（抖音）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"張寶兒開始清潔。（抖音）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260616/1143617987128070144431685.png/fxdygnY0u0wXQ1h-Uj0ZfLisX8dFFZ0meueqBHrnqgQ\"/><figcaption>張寶兒開始清潔。（抖音）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好多BB用品。（抖音）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260616/1143617983810244608695832.png/attEXU4XX03h1Ky4ef_iOuSOqgA2GuCuyo6we8qOsHs\"/><figcaption>好多BB用品。（抖音）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"可愛！（抖音）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260616/1143617981150924800720856.png/R6EHXKZ76D-z8bVSs7fcJOKNRdOZatvMPmeTAD5nkwA\"/><figcaption>可愛！（抖音）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"氣氛溫馨。（抖音）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260616/1143617990949343232045896.png/_0BujRyodVOsHVyM4YcXkjcoyuRK6FWrVkX-XFZF_lw\"/><figcaption>氣氛溫馨。（抖音）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"清潔地板。（抖音）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260616/1143617988659122176629815.png/qBtMup13CTJZ_X3U_nXPMgthL4u25vtZJQnC2iUJwto\"/><figcaption>清潔地板。（抖音）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BB床。（抖音）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260616/1143617986251460608189436.png/MuHVPIiROra64AOHcgfleUCrPpPK6dZ3zWiCqM1ogqg\"/><figcaption>BB床。（抖音）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"熨衫。（抖音）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260616/1143617983847993344684157.png/7IGAiNb_EGXNvlZq_AJz4sCcBqQTQbTAxfZoU8X2aFM\"/><figcaption>熨衫。（抖音）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大功告成！（抖音）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260616/1143617981180284928084732.png/vZG76kZNe-onrVaVqkM-eBvotim6FM-Ns9kKmbPZCpk\"/><figcaption>大功告成！（抖音）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-16T22:38:37.164898+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":647,"images":15,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}